{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114550","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114550","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1511455001:1":{"text":"你……你对顿做了什么？！他是你的信徒！","source_cn":"你……你对顿做了什么？！他是你的信徒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0AE8A4443007C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511455002:1":{"text":"真正的猎手，要会正确评估猎物的力量。","source_cn":"真正的猎手，要会正确评估猎物的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B6D40FD5BFD4AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511455003:1":{"text":"能死在我手中，是他的荣幸。","source_cn":"能死在我手中，是他的荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2897853F4B5963B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511455004:1":{"text":"比起那些死于自相残杀的战士，至少我见证了他的勇气。你该为他感到高兴。","source_cn":"比起那些死于自相残杀的战士，至少我见证了他的勇气。你该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DCE9D3C6272F4D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511455005:1":{"text":"你知道其他人在互相残杀……为什么不阻止他们？！","source_cn":"你知道其他人在互相残杀……为什么不阻止他们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59736582FF7BAFC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511455006:1":{"text":"还有那个恶魔！她搅乱了整个猎血节！","source_cn":"还有那个恶魔！她搅乱了整个猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9020E0EC5E58C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511455007:1":{"text":"你们——雅库伯尔人，是我的造物。你们和丛林里的野兽一样，存在的唯一意义就是取悦我。","source_cn":"你们——雅库伯尔人，是我的造物。你们和丛林里的野兽一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF935B932400A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511455008:1":{"text":"你们应当将一切都敬献给我！鲜血、惨叫——还有生命！","source_cn":"你们应当将一切都敬献给我！鲜血、惨叫——还有生命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x862BD2C9A4072695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511455009:1":{"text":"那个恶魔？她做了些有意思的事，让战士互相猎杀，才能决出最强的猎手。","source_cn":"那个恶魔？她做了些有意思的事，让战士互相猎杀，才能决出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6670B21D0492DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511455010:1":{"text":"她的存在不值一提，但她所做的事可博我一笑，不枉来这世间一回。","source_cn":"她的存在不值一提，但她所做的事可博我一笑，不枉来这世间一回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4F7D437FBAA7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511455011:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511455012:1":{"text":"在你看来，这就是我们存在的意义……？！","source_cn":"在你看来，这就是我们存在的意义……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CFDA3890BFEB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1511455012":{"text":"在你看来，这就是我们存在的意义……？！","source_cn":"在你看来，这就是我们存在的意义……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CFDA3890BFEB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511455013:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511455014:1":{"text":"呵，你居然忍住了，没有挑战崇高的神。","source_cn":"呵，你居然忍住了，没有挑战崇高的神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C839A313B778238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511455015:1":{"text":"看来你已经懂得如何评判狩猎的时机了，很好。","source_cn":"看来你已经懂得如何评判狩猎的时机了，很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557D57F62FD9CC48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu